---
import ToolLayout from '../../layouts/ToolLayout.astro';
import DummyDataGenerator from '../../components/DummyDataGenerator.jsx';
---
<ToolLayout title="SQL Dummy Data Generator" description="Define a simple schema and generate INSERT statements with realistic fake data for testing.">
  <DummyDataGenerator client:load slot="tool" />
  <h2>Why fake data instead of real data</h2>
  <p>Seeding a dev or staging database with realistic-looking data lets you test queries, pagination, and UI without exposing real user records.</p>
</ToolLayout>
